```rust
use ollama_rs::{Ollama, generation::chat::{ChatMessage, request::ChatMessageRequest}};

let ollama = Ollama::new("http://127.0.0.1".to_string(), 11434);
let msgs = vec![ChatMessage::user("hello".to_string())];
let res = ollama.send_chat_messages(ChatMessageRequest::new("gemma4:12b".to_string(), msgs)).await?;
println!("{}", res.message.content);
```

Streaming works too via `send_chat_messages_stream`. Want to wire this into a plugin or into op-web's chat route?
